      "ordered_branches": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "explanation": "Filters one internal container and inner joins shipment. Unordered TOP1 descendant shipment-detail lookup uses tree_unit and non-NULL line number. RFID is MAX of fixed item-class/ship-to CASE classifications across all details of the container shipment, not just contained lines. PL/CSPCS/BOX count all shipment containers with non-NULL IDs using fixed type sets. LEFT JOIN WORK_INSTRUCTION_VIEW by work unit=container ID and fixed instruction type can multiply header rows; ROW_NUMBER then drives MAX/COUNT and integer ((MAX-1)/7)+1 label count. The count is not a count of content detail lines. SHIPBY formats planned month/day with fixed NULL fallback; no final ordering. Unsuffixed variant additionally projects/groups ItemCategory from the unordered selected detail ITEM_CATEGORY2 and shipment carrier CASE.",
